## Why This Is Asked
Engaging; tests concrete tamper-resistance instincts in logging.

## Key Concepts
- Tamper-evident logs
- Per-tenant signing and KMS
- Append-only storage
- Merkle roots for integrity
- Verification pipeline and CI gates

## Code Example
```javascript
// signing a log line with tenant-scoped key
const key = kms.getKey(tenantId);
const last = getLastHash(tenantId);
const payload = JSON.stringify(log);
const hash = sha256(last + payload);
const sig = sign(hash, key);
```

